  "depends_on": ["speech_capability"],
  "description": "THE TARGET: human-equivalent speech understanding across FOUR languages (en/fr/de/es). One CapabilityAxis per language + one `understand` Operator per language (carrying its `lang`). Each measures the agent's understanding by AGREEMENT with multilingual whisper (the human-equivalent reference); target 0.9 = human-equivalent. The understand-drive ranks the four languages and the agent works the one it is furthest below human on, authoring its ear as it must. The operators applies_in speech_world (wired by the driver to the existing Microtheory).",
